### Use with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code.
### The server must be running: npm run dev
### Reset data anytime with: npm run seed

@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### ---------- S6.1 — List courses (10 pts) ----------

### All courses (expect 5 courses)
GET {{base}}/courses

### Search filter (expect 1 course: "Database Fundamentals")
GET {{base}}/courses?search=data

### ---------- S6.2 — Student with enrollments (10 pts) ----------

### Student 1 with enrollments (expect Sok Pisey with 2 enrollments)
GET {{base}}/students/1

### Unknown student (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/students/999

### ---------- S6.3 — Enrollment report, raw SQL (15 pts) ----------

### Expect on fresh seed:
### Web Development Basics = 2 enrollments / $240,
### Database Fundamentals = 2 / $200 (one is DROPPED — still counted,
### the fee is not refunded), Networking Essentials = 1 / $90,
### UX Design Workshop = 1 / $200, JavaScript Programming = 0 / $0
GET {{base}}/reports/course-enrollments

### ---------- S7.1 — Enroll a student (25 pts) ----------

### Happy path (expect 201, status ACTIVE,
### then GET /courses shows course 1 seatsAvailable 18 -> 17)
POST {{base}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 3, "courseId": 1 }

### Course is full: course 5 has 0 seats (expect 409)
POST {{base}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 2, "courseId": 5 }

### Already enrolled: student 1 is ACTIVE in course 1 (expect 409)
POST {{base}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1, "courseId": 1 }

### Re-enroll after drop is ALLOWED: student 2 DROPPED course 2
### (expect 201, seatsAvailable 14 -> 13)
POST {{base}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 2, "courseId": 2 }

### Unknown student (expect 404)
POST {{base}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 999, "courseId": 1 }

### Unknown course (expect 404)
POST {{base}}/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1, "courseId": 999 }

### ---------- S7.2 — Drop an enrollment (10 pts) ----------

### Happy path: enrollment 5 is ACTIVE (expect 200, status DROPPED,
### then GET /courses shows course 4 seatsAvailable 9 -> 10)
PUT {{base}}/enrollments/5/drop

### Drop the same enrollment again (expect 409)
PUT {{base}}/enrollments/5/drop

### Unknown enrollment (expect 404)
PUT {{base}}/enrollments/999/drop
